CLEANUP-BACKLOG.md

# Knowledge graph: track graph.json (the queryable artifact), ignore the rest —
# cache/ and manifest.json are local extraction state, .graphify_python holds an
# absolute interpreter path, graph.html/GRAPH_REPORT.md regenerate from graph.json.
# .claude/ is local hook wiring.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
.claude/
